      "message": "feat(ui): Machines pane kind dropdown filters the list, with an All entry\n\nThe dropdown starts on All (every machine, New blank disabled with a\ntooltip). Picking a kind filters the list to that kind and enables and\naccent-fills New blank. Machines with no stated kind show only under All.\nView state only; nothing is written to the document.\n\nFixes #816\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
